      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "As a note, this is \"fixed\" by removing the timeline asset from the world entirely on load. It is invalid because the audio track is missing a bound AudioSource for the output. Unity cannot fix this up at runtime, so for security reasons we need to prevent it from playing in general.",
