  "details": "World: https://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_c6959e8a-7a70-4a18-b88f-f55ea7faf442\n\nWhile video player can toggle off sound though VRChat Menu,\n\nParticle live which start by cube located next to spawn cannot be turn off with any volume control.\n\nI believe this is edge case but better get checked.\n\n(as always 100% without adjustment not sounds good at all)",
